From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:18:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] media: rockchip: rkvenc: Add the RK3528 VEPU540C JPEG back
 end

The RK3528's VEPU540C codes baseline JPEG beside H.264 and HEVC, from
its own register block and reciprocal quantiser tables. The driver
writes each picture's header, with the Annex K tables scaled to the
JPEG compression quality, and the core codes the scan after it.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
